e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1209","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"NPC对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【奥贝德】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e好无聊啊。大哥哥们又不让咱打水漂，要不——\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【希尔米】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e哇，你不会又要提议那个了吧⋯\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【奥贝德】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e对，就是那个——\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e「保卫阿如村·大演习」！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e第一步，先封路！走，我们去堵住吊桥⋯\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【希尔米】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e不要了吧。在我们跑到吊桥之前，就会被哈巴奇哥哥抓回来的⋯\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【奥贝德】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e那、那怎么办嘛⋯要不你想个好玩的游戏？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【希尔米】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e唔⋯要不我们比赛去爬···什么颜色来着，我总是忘记名字。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e⋯总之就是爬那个升降梯！看谁爬得更快更高！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e【奥贝德】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e哇，听上去还挺有意思的！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e但是换这个的话，一定又会被卡齐姆大叔教训了吧！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1210","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"card_group_info","layout":"","data":"{\"author\":\"\",\"created_at\":\"\",\"list\":[]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1211","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true}\n","style":""}],"id":"1212","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1762236941","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"69","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"691","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1207","pos":"left"},{"id":"1208","pos":"right"}],"name":"","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"692","layou